// In-game registration form. The panel is at its screen position. Every other
// gadget is relative to that panel. The loader builds this screen. The panel
// draws no picture of its own, so the green console layer shows through it;
// the fields and the status list are outlined in palette 90. Password and
// Confirm draw a star for each character. The status list is the idle
// advice; the console replaces it while a request is out.
